      "message": "On Windows `user_config_path(\"gerrit-mcp\")` defaults `appauthor` to the app name, so the real path is `%LOCALAPPDATA%\\gerrit-mcp\\gerrit-mcp\\gerrit_config.json`. The setup skill reads this same line from `references/gerrit-config.md`, so on Windows it would write a file the server never finds. Either fix the docs (both files) or pass `appauthor\u003dFalse` in `main.py` and in the README snippet.",
